(1, '/', 'Calcify Hub | Home Page', 'This is a Home Page', '\"{\\\"0\\\":\\\"Try this\\\",\\\"1\\\":\\\"Scientific Calculator\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"sin\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"cos\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"tan\\\",\\\"5\\\":\\\"^\\\",\\\"6\\\":\\\"\\\\u221a\\\",\\\"7\\\":\\\"log\\\",\\\"8\\\":\\\"ln\\\",\\\"9\\\":\\\"(\\\",\\\"10\\\":\\\")\\\",\\\"11\\\":\\\"\\\\u03c0\\\",\\\"12\\\":\\\"7\\\",\\\"13\\\":\\\"8\\\",\\\"14\\\":\\\"9\\\",\\\"15\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"16\\\":\\\"x!\\\",\\\"17\\\":\\\"4\\\",\\\"18\\\":\\\"5\\\",\\\"19\\\":\\\"6\\\",\\\"20\\\":\\\"\\\\u00d7\\\",\\\"21\\\":\\\"%\\\",\\\"22\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"23\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"24\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"25\\\":\\\"-\\\",\\\"26\\\":\\\"e\\\",\\\"27\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"28\\\":\\\".\\\",\\\"29\\\":\\\"+\\\",\\\"30\\\":\\\"=\\\",\\\"31\\\":\\\"C\\\",\\\"32\\\":\\\"Popular Tools\\\",\\\"33\\\":\\\"Tools Most Frequently Accessed and Utilized by Our Visitors Daily\\\",\\\"34\\\":\\\"Age Calculator\\\",\\\"35\\\":\\\"Calculate your exact age, time to next birthday, or age difference between two individuals with ease.\\\",\\\"36\\\":\\\"Tax Calculator\\\",\\\"37\\\":\\\"Calculate your income tax accurately using Pakistan\'s official tax slabs, deductions, and rules for salaried individuals.\\\",\\\"38\\\":\\\"Budget-Based Solar Calculator\\\",\\\"39\\\":\\\"Estimate the ideal solar panel setup based on your budget, energy needs, and current electricity rates in Pakistan.\\\",\\\"40\\\":\\\"Solar Power Calculator\\\",\\\"41\\\":\\\"Calculate your daily solar power consumption based on appliance usage, wattage, and total energy requirements in Pakistan.\\\",\\\"42\\\":\\\"Construction Cost Calculator\\\",\\\"43\\\":\\\"Estimate your construction cost based on area, material quality, and labor rates using this accurate and easy calculator.\\\",\\\"44\\\":\\\"Introduction to Calcify Hub\\\",\\\"45\\\":\\\"Calcify Hub is your go-to resource for useful, approachable tools made to make difficult jobs easier. No sign-ups, simply user-friendly tools designed to save you time and effort. Whether you\'re planning a solar energy setup, estimating building expenses, formatting text for professional usage, or calculating your age with a playful twist, our tools give accurate, quick data downloads. Our platform was developed with practical applications in mind, offering dependable solutions at no cost to developers, professionals, students, and homeowners.\\\",\\\"46\\\":\\\"What are the Features of Calcify Hub\\\",\\\"47\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83d\\\\udd0b Budget-Based Solar Estimator\\\",\\\"48\\\":\\\"Easily plan your investment in solar energy. This calculator determines how many solar panels you can purchase across a range of wattage possibilities (e.g., 300W, 500W) if you just enter your budget in Pakistani Rupees (PKR). Additionally, it calculates how much an appropriate inverter would cost for your arrangement. Clear results are displayed, and with just one click, you can create a polished PDF report for convenient sharing or record-keeping.\\\",\\\"49\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83d\\\\udd0b Usage-Based Solar Estimator\\\",\\\"50\\\":\\\"Adjust the solar power system to the demands of your home. Enter the number and wattage needs of the appliances you select, such as fans, lights, and air conditioners. The program rapidly determines the quantity of solar panels and the necessary inverter, and you may modify the cost per watt depending on current market rates. You may get a comprehensive PDF report for your records and modify panel pricing in real-time inside the interactive table.\\\",\\\"51\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83e\\\\uddf1 Construction Cost Estimator\\\",\\\"52\\\":\\\"Use this complete tool to streamline your building planning. Enter specifics like the overall area, number of floors, number of rooms per floor, and the sizes and numbers of windows and doors and sizes. The tools offer a thorough analysis of the price of various building supplies, including bricks and cement. To share with contractors or use for budgeting, save your estimate as a PDF.\\\",\\\"53\\\":\\\"\\\\u270d\\\\ufe0f Text Formatter\\\",\\\"54\\\":\\\"This tool is ideal for writers  and developers since it makes text changes with ease. One one click remove spaces and change the text to kebab-case, Pascal-case, camel-case, All caps, or sentence-case. It is perfect for coding, content development, and academic writing since it offers comprehensive data, such as word count, letter count, and character count.\\\",\\\"55\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83c\\\\udf82 Age Calculator with Fun Facts\\\",\\\"56\\\":\\\"This tool is more than just an age calculator. On one click, it calculates your precise age on based of your birthdate and also has some playful elements. Find out your zodiac sign or birth year, as well as your birthstone and birth flower. For students, trivia fans, or anybody else interested in their accomplishments, it\'s a fun tool.\\\",\\\"57\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83d\\\\udcc4 PDF Reports\\\",\\\"58\\\":\\\"Most of our tools offer a\\\",\\\"59\\\":\\\"Download PDF\\\",\\\"60\\\":\\\"feature, allowing you to save professional, well-formatted reports. Whether it\\\\u2019s a solar estimate, construction cost breakdown, or formatted text output, you can easily store or share your results for future reference.\\\",\\\"61\\\":\\\"\\\\ud83d\\\\udcbc Use Cases of Calcify Hub\\\",\\\"62\\\":\\\"Homeowners & estate Developers:\\\",\\\"63\\\":\\\"Before hiring contractors, use the Construction Cost Estimator to precisely budget for home-building projects or the Budget-Based and Usage-Based Solar Estimators to design sustainable energy solutions.\\\",\\\"64\\\":\\\"Students & Educators:\\\",\\\"65\\\":\\\"Use the Text Formatter to prepare essays, reports, or code snippets with exact word and character counts, or the Age Calculator for entertaining and instructive insights.\\\",\\\"66\\\":\\\"Professionals & Small Business Owners:\\\",\\\"67\\\":\\\"Save time with dynamic estimators for solar or construction projects, and export detailed PDF reports for presentations, proposals, or client discussions.\\\",\\\"68\\\":\\\"Developers & Content Creators:\\\",\\\"69\\\":\\\"Developers & Content Creators: Streamline coding and writing tasks with the Text Formatter, which supports multiple case conversions and provides detailed text analytics for efficient content management.\\\",\\\"70\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\",\\\"71\\\":\\\"Are these tools really free to use?\\\",\\\"72\\\":\\\"Yes, all tools on Smart Tools Hub are 100% free, with no subscriptions, registrations, or hidden fees required.\\\",\\\"73\\\":\\\"Can I access these tools on my mobile device?\\\",\\\"74\\\":\\\"Absolutely! Our platform is fully responsive, ensuring a seamless                         experience on smartphones, tablets, and desktops.\\\",\\\"75\\\":\\\"Can I save or share my results?\\\",\\\"76\\\":\\\"Yes, most tools include a\\\",\\\"77\\\":\\\"option, allowing you to save or                         share professional reports, such as solar estimates or construction cost breakdowns.\\\",\\\"78\\\":\\\"How accurate are the estimators?\\\",\\\"79\\\":\\\"Our estimators use industry-standard formulas and allow real-time customization (e.g., per-watt pricing or material costs) for practical results. However, for critical decisions, we recommend consulting professionals to validate estimates.\\\",\\\"80\\\":\\\"Will you add more tools in the future?\\\",\\\"81\\\":\\\"Yes, we\\\\u2019re committed to expanding our toolset based on user needs. Have an idea for a new tool? Contact us through our website, and we\\\\u2019ll consider your suggestions!\\\",\\\"82\\\":\\\"Lightning Fast\\\",\\\"83\\\":\\\"Our tools process your requests instantly with no waiting time.\\\",\\\"84\\\":\\\"Secure & Private\\\",\\\"85\\\":\\\"All conversions happen in your browser - we don\'t store your data.\\\",\\\"86\\\":\\\"Mobile Friendly\\\",\\\"87\\\":\\\"Use our tools on any device, anywhere, without compromise.\\\",\\\"h-0\\\":\\\"Calcify\\\",\\\"h-1\\\":\\\"Hub\\\",\\\"h-2\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"h-3\\\":\\\"Tools\\\",\\\"h-4\\\":\\\"Estimators\\\",\\\"h-5\\\":\\\"Usage Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-6\\\":\\\"Budget Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-7\\\":\\\"Construction Base\\\",\\\"h-8\\\":\\\"Formatters & Convertors\\\",\\\"h-9\\\":\\\"Text Formatter\\\",\\\"h-10\\\":\\\"Text Encrypt\\\\\\/Decrypt\\\",\\\"h-11\\\":\\\"Image Converter\\\",\\\"h-12\\\":\\\"Pdf To word\\\",\\\"h-13\\\":\\\"Others\\\",\\\"h-14\\\":\\\"Age Calculator\\\",\\\"h-15\\\":\\\"Tax Calculator\\\",\\\"h-16\\\":\\\"Minify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-17\\\":\\\"Unminify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-18\\\":\\\"Compare Data\\\",\\\"h-19\\\":\\\"About Us\\\",\\\"h-20\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"f-0\\\":\\\"Your Daily Utility Hub\\\",\\\"f-1\\\":\\\"Pages\\\",\\\"f-2\\\":\\\"Newsletter\\\",\\\"f-3\\\":\\\"Subscribe to get updates on new tools and features.\\\",\\\"f-4\\\":\\\"Your email\\\",\\\"f-5\\\":\\\"Subscribe\\\",\\\"f-6\\\":\\\"\\\\u00a9 2025 Calcify Hub. All rights reserved.\\\",\\\"f-7\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"f-8\\\":\\\"Terms & Conditions\\\"}\"', '2025-07-21 05:05:37', '2025-08-01 01:04:17'),
(2, '/age-calculator', 'Calcify Hub | Age Calculator', 'This is Age Calculator', '\"{\\\"0\\\":\\\"Age\\\",\\\"1\\\":\\\"Calculator\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Calculate your exact age, time until your next birthday, or the age difference between two people.\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Enter Your Date of Birth\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Date\\\",\\\"5\\\":\\\"Time (optional)\\\",\\\"6\\\":\\\"Compare with another date (optional)\\\",\\\"7\\\":\\\"Your Age Information\\\",\\\"8\\\":\\\"Years\\\",\\\"9\\\":\\\"Months\\\",\\\"10\\\":\\\"Days\\\",\\\"11\\\":\\\"Hours\\\",\\\"12\\\":\\\"Total in different units:\\\",\\\"13\\\":\\\"Minutes\\\",\\\"14\\\":\\\"Seconds\\\",\\\"15\\\":\\\"Milliseconds\\\",\\\"16\\\":\\\"Next Birthday:\\\",\\\"17\\\":\\\"Interesting Facts\\\",\\\"18\\\":\\\"Zodiac Sign\\\",\\\"19\\\":\\\"Generation\\\",\\\"20\\\":\\\"Birthstone\\\",\\\"21\\\":\\\"Birth Flower\\\",\\\"22\\\":\\\"Historical Events\\\",\\\"23\\\":\\\"Calculate\\\",\\\"24\\\":\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"25\\\":\\\"Generate Pdf Report\\\",\\\"h-0\\\":\\\"Calcify\\\",\\\"h-1\\\":\\\"Hub\\\",\\\"h-2\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"h-3\\\":\\\"Tools\\\",\\\"h-4\\\":\\\"Estimators\\\",\\\"h-5\\\":\\\"Usage Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-6\\\":\\\"Budget Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-7\\\":\\\"Construction Cost\\\",\\\"h-8\\\":\\\"Formatters & Convertors\\\",\\\"h-9\\\":\\\"Text Formatter\\\",\\\"h-10\\\":\\\"Text Encrypt\\\\\\/Decrypt\\\",\\\"h-11\\\":\\\"Image Converter\\\",\\\"h-12\\\":\\\"Pdf To word\\\",\\\"h-13\\\":\\\"Others\\\",\\\"h-14\\\":\\\"Age Calculator\\\",\\\"h-15\\\":\\\"Tax Calculator\\\",\\\"h-16\\\":\\\"Minify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-17\\\":\\\"Unminify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-18\\\":\\\"Compare Data\\\",\\\"h-19\\\":\\\"About Us\\\",\\\"h-20\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"f-0\\\":\\\"Your Daily Utility Hub\\\",\\\"f-1\\\":\\\"Pages\\\",\\\"f-2\\\":\\\"Newsletter\\\",\\\"f-3\\\":\\\"Subscribe to get updates on new tools and features.\\\",\\\"f-4\\\":\\\"Your email\\\",\\\"f-5\\\":\\\"Subscribe\\\",\\\"f-6\\\":\\\"\\\\u00a9 2025 Calcify Hub. All rights reserved.\\\",\\\"f-7\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"f-8\\\":\\\"Terms & Conditions\\\"}\"', '2025-07-21 05:09:51', '2025-08-01 01:04:45'),
(3, '/usage-base-solar-estimator', 'Calcify Hub | Usage Base Solar Estimator', 'This is a Usage base Solar Estimator', '\"{\\\"0\\\":\\\"Usage-based\\\",\\\"1\\\":\\\"Solar Estimator\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Estiamte of solar panel and cost according usage of appliances, and save it as Pdf\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Select Your Appliances\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Lighting\\\",\\\"5\\\":\\\"LED\\\\\\/CFL Bulb\\\",\\\"6\\\":\\\"Halogen Bulb\\\",\\\"7\\\":\\\"Entertainment\\\",\\\"8\\\":\\\"LED TV\\\",\\\"9\\\":\\\"Cooling\\\",\\\"10\\\":\\\"Ceiling Fan\\\",\\\"11\\\":\\\"AC - 1 Ton\\\",\\\"12\\\":\\\"AC - 1.5 Ton\\\",\\\"13\\\":\\\"AC - 2 Ton\\\",\\\"14\\\":\\\"Kitchen\\\",\\\"15\\\":\\\"Refrigerator\\\",\\\"16\\\":\\\"Freezer\\\",\\\"17\\\":\\\"Chest Freezer\\\",\\\"18\\\":\\\"Mini Fridge\\\",\\\"19\\\":\\\"Dishwasher\\\",\\\"20\\\":\\\"Electric Oven\\\",\\\"21\\\":\\\"Microwave Oven\\\",\\\"22\\\":\\\"Toaster\\\",\\\"23\\\":\\\"Toaster Oven\\\",\\\"24\\\":\\\"Coffee Maker\\\",\\\"25\\\":\\\"Electric Kettle\\\",\\\"26\\\":\\\"Household\\\",\\\"27\\\":\\\"Washing Machine\\\",\\\"28\\\":\\\"Clothes Dryer\\\",\\\"29\\\":\\\"Hair Dryer\\\",\\\"30\\\":\\\"Clothes Iron\\\",\\\"31\\\":\\\"Space Heater\\\",\\\"32\\\":\\\"Vacuum Cleaner\\\",\\\"33\\\":\\\"Space Dehumidifier\\\",\\\"34\\\":\\\"Water Dispenser\\\",\\\"35\\\":\\\"Others\\\",\\\"36\\\":\\\"Water Pump - 0.5 HP\\\",\\\"37\\\":\\\"Water Pump - 1 HP\\\",\\\"38\\\":\\\"Desktop Computer\\\",\\\"39\\\":\\\"Laptop\\\",\\\"40\\\":\\\"Water Heater\\\",\\\"41\\\":\\\"Router\\\\\\/Clock Radio\\\",\\\"42\\\":\\\"Watts\\\",\\\"43\\\":\\\"Qty\\\",\\\"44\\\":\\\"Enter Price Of Panel Per Watt (According Market)\\\",\\\"45\\\":\\\"Enter amount\\\",\\\"46\\\":\\\"Calculate\\\",\\\"47\\\":\\\"Calculating...\\\",\\\"48\\\":\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"49\\\":\\\"Reseting...\\\",\\\"50\\\":\\\"How to Use the Solar Panels Cost Estimator\\\",\\\"51\\\":\\\"This solar panel cost estimator is an easy-to-use tool that assists you in figuring out how much solar electricity you\'ll need and the related expenses for operating appliances in Pakistan throughout the day. Based on the information you enter, the tool calculates the quantity of solar panels, the size of the inverter, and the overall cost (including installation). To make efficient use of the calculator, adhere to this detailed tutorial.\\\",\\\"52\\\":\\\"Select Appliances\\\",\\\"53\\\":\\\"Add an appliance by checking the box next to it (e.g., fans, lights, air conditioners). Appliance\'s wattage and quantity input fields are visible when it is checked.\\\",\\\"54\\\":\\\"Enter Wattage\\\",\\\"55\\\":\\\"Input the power consumption in watts (W) for each selected appliance, found on the appliance\\\\u2019s label or manual (e.g., ceiling fan: 75W, refrigerator: 150W). Estimate if unsure.\\\",\\\"56\\\":\\\"Enter Quantity\\\",\\\"57\\\":\\\"Specify the number of each appliance (e.g., 3 fans).\\\",\\\"58\\\":\\\"Validation\\\",\\\"59\\\":\\\"Ensure wattage and quantity are positive numbers (greater than 0). Invalid inputs will trigger an alert during calculation.\\\",\\\"60\\\":\\\"Enter Panel Price\\\",\\\"61\\\":\\\"Panel Price Per Watt\\\",\\\"62\\\":\\\"Enter the cost of solar panels per watt in Pakistani Rupees (Rs.) in the \\\\u201cPanel Price Per Watt\\\\u201d field (e.g., Rs. 50 per watt).\\\",\\\"63\\\":\\\"Dynamic Updates\\\",\\\"64\\\":\\\"Changing the panel price after calculating results will automatically update costs if the results section is visible.\\\",\\\"65\\\":\\\"Calculate Solar Requirements\\\",\\\"66\\\":\\\"Click Calculate\\\",\\\"67\\\":\\\"Press the Calculate button to process inputs. The button switches to \\\\u201cCalculating\\\\u2026\\\\u201d for 0.5 seconds.\\\",\\\"68\\\":\\\"Input Validation\\\",\\\"69\\\":\\\"No appliances selected: \\\\u201cKindly select an appliance from the list.\\\\u201d\\\",\\\"70\\\":\\\"Invalid wattage\\\\\\/quantity: \\\\u201cPlease enter valid wattage and quantity for at least one checked appliance.\\\\u201d\\\",\\\"71\\\":\\\"Empty\\\\\\/invalid panel price: \\\\u201cPlease Enter Price Of Panel Per Watt.\\\\u201d\\\",\\\"72\\\":\\\"Results Displayed\\\",\\\"73\\\":\\\"Power Requirements\\\",\\\"74\\\":\\\"Required Watts: Total power consumption (wattage \\\\u00d7 quantity).\\\",\\\"75\\\":\\\"20% Buffer: Additional 20% power for system losses.\\\",\\\"76\\\":\\\"Total Watts Needed: Required watts plus buffer.\\\",\\\"77\\\":\\\"Inverter Requirements\\\",\\\"78\\\":\\\"Inverter Size: Rounded up to 3 kW, 5 kW, or 10 kW.\\\",\\\"79\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Options Estimates for\\\",\\\"80\\\":\\\"Small (150W): Panels needed, power generated, costs.\\\",\\\"81\\\":\\\"Medium (350W): Panels needed, power generated, costs.\\\",\\\"82\\\":\\\"Large (585W): Panels needed, power generated, costs.\\\",\\\"83\\\":\\\"Installation Cost: Fixed at Rs. 30,000.\\\",\\\"84\\\":\\\"Scroll to Results\\\",\\\"85\\\":\\\"The results table appears, and the page scrolls to it.\\\",\\\"86\\\":\\\"Review Results\\\",\\\"87\\\":\\\"Results Table\\\",\\\"88\\\":\\\"Compare Small, Medium, and Large panel options, showing: Number of panels needed.\\\",\\\"89\\\":\\\"Use Case\\\",\\\"90\\\":\\\"Choose a panel size based on budget and space. Large panels (585W) may save costs but need more space; small panels (150W) are better for constrained spaces.\\\",\\\"91\\\":\\\"Generate a PDF Report\\\",\\\"92\\\":\\\"Generate PDF\\\",\\\"93\\\":\\\"Click Generate PDF after results appear. The button switches to \\\\u201cGenerating PDF\\\\u2026\\\\u201d for 0.5 seconds.\\\",\\\"94\\\":\\\"PDF Content\\\",\\\"95\\\":\\\"Header: Title, subtitle, and generation date\\\\\\/time.\\\",\\\"96\\\":\\\"Selected Appliances: Table with appliance name, wattage, quantity, and total watts.\\\",\\\"97\\\":\\\"Panel Price: Price per watt\\\",\\\"98\\\":\\\"Power Requirements: Required watts, buffer, total watts.\\\",\\\"99\\\":\\\"Inverter Requirements: Size and cost.\\\",\\\"100\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Options: Table comparing Small, Medium, Large panels.\\\",\\\"101\\\":\\\"Notes: Daytime-only operation, estimated prices, 20% buffer.\\\",\\\"102\\\":\\\"Footer: Page numbers and \\\\u201cSolar Generate\\\\u201d branding.\\\",\\\"103\\\":\\\"Download\\\",\\\"104\\\":\\\"Saved as Solar_Report_YYYYMMDD.pdf (e.g., Solar_Report_20250716.pdf).\\\",\\\"105\\\":\\\"Reset the Calculator\\\",\\\"106\\\":\\\"Reset Inputs\\\",\\\"107\\\":\\\"Click Reset to clear all inputs. The button switches to \\\\u201cResetting\\\\u2026\\\\u201d for 0.5 seconds.\\\",\\\"108\\\":\\\"What Happens\\\",\\\"109\\\":\\\"Unchecks all appliance checkboxes.\\\",\\\"110\\\":\\\"Hides and disables wattage\\\\\\/quantity fields, clearing their values.\\\",\\\"111\\\":\\\"Clears panel price field to \\\\u201cEnter amount\\\\u201d placeholder.\\\",\\\"112\\\":\\\"Resets result fields to defaults (e.g., 0 W, Rs. 0).\\\",\\\"113\\\":\\\"Hides results table and Generate PDF button; shows Calculate button.\\\",\\\"114\\\":\\\"Tips for Effective Use\\\",\\\"115\\\":\\\"Accurate Inputs\\\",\\\"116\\\":\\\"Use accurate wattage and quantity values for precise calculations. Check appliance labels or manuals.\\\",\\\"117\\\":\\\"Panel Price Research\\\",\\\"118\\\":\\\"Research current market prices in Pakistan for realistic panel pricing.\\\",\\\"119\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Sizes\\\",\\\"120\\\":\\\"Use the results table to find the most cost-effective or space-efficient panel size.\\\",\\\"121\\\":\\\"Daytime Operation\\\",\\\"122\\\":\\\"The calculator assumes daytime-only operation without battery storage. Additional components are needed for off-grid or nighttime use.\\\",\\\"123\\\":\\\"Save Your PDF\\\",\\\"124\\\":\\\"The PDF report is a useful reference for planning or vendor discussions.\\\",\\\"125\\\":\\\"Example Scenario\\\",\\\"126\\\":\\\"Check \\\\u201cCeiling Fan\\\\u201d (75W, quantity: 3).\\\",\\\"127\\\":\\\"Check \\\\u201cLED Light\\\\u201d (10W, quantity: 5).\\\",\\\"128\\\":\\\"Input Rs. 50 per watt.\\\",\\\"129\\\":\\\"Total Watts: (75 \\\\u00d7 3) + (10 \\\\u00d7 5) = 275W.\\\",\\\"130\\\":\\\"Buffer (20%): 55W.\\\",\\\"131\\\":\\\"Total Watts Needed: 330W.\\\",\\\"132\\\":\\\"Inverter Size: 3 kW (minimum).\\\",\\\"133\\\":\\\"Inverter Cost: 3,000 \\\\u00d7 25 = Rs. 75,000.\\\",\\\"134\\\":\\\"Small Panels (150W): 3 panels, 450W, Rs. 22,500 (3 \\\\u00d7 150 \\\\u00d7 50).\\\",\\\"135\\\":\\\"Medium Panels (350W): 1 panel, 350W, Rs. 17,500 (1 \\\\u00d7 350 \\\\u00d7 50).\\\",\\\"136\\\":\\\"Large Panels (585W): 1 panel, 585W, Rs. 29,250 (1 \\\\u00d7 585 \\\\u00d7 50).\\\",\\\"137\\\":\\\"Total Costs: Include Rs. 30,000 installation fee.\\\",\\\"138\\\":\\\"Review\\\",\\\"139\\\":\\\"Choose Medium (350W) for lowest cost (Rs. 122,500).\\\",\\\"140\\\":\\\"Save the report.\\\",\\\"141\\\":\\\"Clear inputs for a new calculation.\\\",\\\"142\\\":\\\"This Solar Panels Cost Estimator simplifies planning a solar power system, providing clear, actionable insights. For further assistance, feel free to ask!\\\",\\\"143\\\":\\\"Power Required\\\",\\\"144\\\":\\\"Adding 20% Buffer\\\",\\\"145\\\":\\\"Total Power Requirement\\\",\\\"146\\\":\\\"Inverter Required\\\",\\\"147\\\":\\\"Required Inverter\\\",\\\"148\\\":\\\"Inverter Cost\\\",\\\"149\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Requirements\\\",\\\"150\\\":\\\"Panel Type\\\",\\\"151\\\":\\\"Power Output\\\",\\\"152\\\":\\\"Single Panel Price\\\",\\\"153\\\":\\\"Quantity Needed\\\",\\\"154\\\":\\\"Power Generated\\\",\\\"155\\\":\\\"Panel Cost\\\",\\\"156\\\":\\\"Installation Cost\\\",\\\"157\\\":\\\"Total Cost\\\",\\\"158\\\":\\\"Panels Needed\\\",\\\"159\\\":\\\"Small (150W)\\\",\\\"160\\\":\\\"Medium (350W)\\\",\\\"161\\\":\\\"Large (585W)\\\",\\\"162\\\":\\\"Note: Costs include solar panels, inverter, and installation for daytime operation. No battery included.\\\",\\\"h-0\\\":\\\"Calcify\\\",\\\"h-1\\\":\\\"Hub\\\",\\\"h-2\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"h-3\\\":\\\"Tools\\\",\\\"h-4\\\":\\\"Estimators\\\",\\\"h-5\\\":\\\"Usage Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-6\\\":\\\"Budget Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-7\\\":\\\"Construction Base\\\",\\\"h-8\\\":\\\"Formatters & Convertors\\\",\\\"h-9\\\":\\\"Text Formatter\\\",\\\"h-10\\\":\\\"Text Encrypt\\\\\\/Decrypt\\\",\\\"h-11\\\":\\\"Image Converter\\\",\\\"h-12\\\":\\\"Pdf To word\\\",\\\"h-13\\\":\\\"Others\\\",\\\"h-14\\\":\\\"Age Calculator\\\",\\\"h-15\\\":\\\"Tax Calculator\\\",\\\"h-16\\\":\\\"Minify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-17\\\":\\\"Unminify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-18\\\":\\\"Compare Data\\\",\\\"h-19\\\":\\\"About Us\\\",\\\"h-20\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"f-0\\\":\\\"Your Daily Utility Hub\\\",\\\"f-1\\\":\\\"Pages\\\",\\\"f-2\\\":\\\"Newsletter\\\",\\\"f-3\\\":\\\"Subscribe to get updates on new tools and features.\\\",\\\"f-4\\\":\\\"Your email\\\",\\\"f-5\\\":\\\"Subscribe\\\",\\\"f-6\\\":\\\"\\\\u00a9 2025 Calcify Hub. All rights reserved.\\\",\\\"f-7\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"f-8\\\":\\\"Terms & Conditions\\\"}\"', '2025-07-21 06:18:13', '2025-08-01 01:11:34'),
(4, '/budget-base-solar-estimator', 'Calcify Hub | Budget Base Solar Estimator', 'This is a budget base solar estimator', '\"{\\\"0\\\":\\\"Budget-Based\\\",\\\"1\\\":\\\"Solar Estimator\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Calculate your exact age, time until your next birthday, or the age difference between two people.\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Budget-Based Calculation\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Your Budget (\\\\u20a8)\\\",\\\"5\\\":\\\"Enter Your Budget\\\",\\\"6\\\":\\\"Calculate\\\",\\\"7\\\":\\\"Calculating...\\\",\\\"8\\\":\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"9\\\":\\\"Reseting...\\\",\\\"10\\\":\\\"How to Use the Solar System Calculator\\\",\\\"11\\\":\\\"A user-friendly online tool called the Solar System Calculator was created to assist you with budget-conscious solar power system planning. You can examine several solar panel configurations (Small 150W, Medium 350W, and Large 550W), read comprehensive cost breakdowns, and get appliance suggestions for daytime operation by entering your budget and personalising panel costs. This manual offers detailed instructions for making the most of the tool\'s capabilities.\\\",\\\"12\\\":\\\"Table of Contents\\\",\\\"13\\\":\\\"Overview\\\",\\\"14\\\":\\\"Prerequisites\\\",\\\"15\\\":\\\"Inputting Your Budget\\\",\\\"16\\\":\\\"Customizing Panel Prices\\\",\\\"17\\\":\\\"Calculating Results\\\",\\\"18\\\":\\\"Understanding the Output\\\",\\\"19\\\":\\\"Recommended Appliances\\\",\\\"20\\\":\\\"Generating a PDF Report\\\",\\\"21\\\":\\\"Resetting the Tool\\\",\\\"22\\\":\\\"Additional Notes\\\",\\\"23\\\":\\\"This Budget Base Solar Panel Estimator allows you to:\\\",\\\"24\\\":\\\"Find out how many solar panels you can afford in the budget you entered.\\\",\\\"25\\\":\\\"More accurate results, adjust the price of the 150W, 350W, and 550W small, medium, and large solar panels.\\\",\\\"26\\\":\\\"See comprehensive cost breakdowns that include installation, panel, and inverter expenses.\\\",\\\"27\\\":\\\"View the power produced once a 30% loss factor is taken into consideration.\\\",\\\"28\\\":\\\"Find out which appliances are compatible with each panel setup.\\\",\\\"29\\\":\\\"Create a report in PDF format that summarises the computations.\\\",\\\"30\\\":\\\"The instrument has a set installation cost of Rs. 30,000 and is designed to operate during the day without the need for battery storage. The 3kW, 5kW, and 10kW inverters it supports cost Rs. 30,000, Rs. 60,000, and Rs. 110,000, respectively.\\\",\\\"31\\\":\\\"A modern web browser (e.g., Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge).\\\",\\\"32\\\":\\\"Internet access to load the jsPDF library for PDF generation (included in the tool).\\\",\\\"33\\\":\\\"Basic understanding of your budget and desired solar panel system.\\\",\\\"34\\\":\\\"Find the\\\",\\\"35\\\":\\\"Budget Amount\\\",\\\"36\\\":\\\"input form, marked \\\\\\\"Enter Your Budget (PKR)\\\\\\\" at the top of the page.\\\",\\\"37\\\":\\\"Enter the Pakistani Rupees (PKR) for your budget. Type 200000 for Rs. 200,000 for instance.\\\",\\\"38\\\":\\\"Since the tool requires a minimum of Rs. 150,000, make sure the budget is at least that amount. An alert will prompt you to increase the amount if you enter a smaller number.\\\",\\\"39\\\":\\\"Tip:\\\",\\\"40\\\":\\\"Use whole numbers without commas or currency symbols (e.g., 150000 instead of Rs. 150,000 or 150,000).\\\",\\\"41\\\":\\\"The tool provides default prices for solar panels:\\\",\\\"42\\\":\\\"Small (150W): Rs. 7,500\\\",\\\"43\\\":\\\"Medium (350W): Rs. 16,000\\\",\\\"44\\\":\\\"Large (550W): Rs. 22,000\\\",\\\"45\\\":\\\"To adjust these prices:\\\",\\\"46\\\":\\\"Single Panel Price\\\",\\\"47\\\":\\\"column in the solar panel table.\\\",\\\"48\\\":\\\"The selected panel type, enter a new price in the input field (for example, change 7500 to 8000 for Small panels).\\\",\\\"49\\\":\\\"Make sure the price is greater than zero. The tool might not provide correct answers if you enter improper data, such as letters or negative number.\\\",\\\"50\\\":\\\"Ensure prices are positive numbers. If you enter invalid values (e.g., letters or negative numbers), the tool may not calculate correctly.\\\",\\\"51\\\":\\\"Note:\\\",\\\"52\\\":\\\"Changing panel prices affects the number of panels you can afford within your budget and the resulting power output.\\\",\\\"53\\\":\\\"Click the\\\",\\\"54\\\":\\\"button (designated by a calculator icon or text) once you have entered a suitable budget and made any necessary panel price adjustments within your budget,\\\",\\\"55\\\":\\\"The tool will:\\\",\\\"56\\\":\\\"Determine the most panels you can purchase of each size (small, medium, and large).\\\",\\\"57\\\":\\\"Calculate the power produced while taking a 30% loss factor into consideration.\\\",\\\"58\\\":\\\"Depending on the power output, choose an inverter size of 3kW, 5kW, or 10kW, with a 1.25x multiplier for peak demand.\\\",\\\"59\\\":\\\"Show the entire cost, which includes the Rs. 30,000 fixed installation fee, panel and inverter charges, and other expenses.\\\",\\\"60\\\":\\\"An notice will be displayed and no calculations will be displayed if the budget is invalid (for example, empty or less than Rs. 150,000).\\\",\\\"61\\\":\\\"The results are displayed in a table with the following columns for each panel type (Small, Medium, Large):\\\",\\\"62\\\":\\\"Panel Type\\\",\\\"63\\\":\\\"The type of panel (e.g., Small (150W)).\\\",\\\"64\\\":\\\"Single Panel Price\\\",\\\"65\\\":\\\"The cost per panel, editable by you.\\\",\\\"66\\\":\\\"Quantity\\\",\\\"67\\\":\\\"The number of panels you can afford within your budget (e.g., \\\\\\\"5 Panels\\\\\\\").\\\",\\\"68\\\":\\\"Panel Cost\\\",\\\"69\\\":\\\"Total cost for the panels (e.g., \\\\\\\"Rs. 37,500\\\\\\\" for 5 Small panels at Rs. 7,500 each).\\\",\\\"70\\\":\\\"Power Generated Loss 30%\\\",\\\"71\\\":\\\"The total power generated, showing original power, loss amount, and net power after 30% losses (e.g., \\\\\\\"750 W - 225 W (30%) = 525 W\\\\\\\").\\\",\\\"72\\\":\\\"Inverter Size\\\",\\\"73\\\":\\\"The required inverter size (3kW, 5kW, or 10kW) based on the net power.\\\",\\\"74\\\":\\\"Inverter Cost\\\",\\\"75\\\":\\\"The cost of the selected inverter (e.g., \\\\\\\"Rs. 30,000\\\\\\\" for a 3kW inverter).\\\",\\\"76\\\":\\\"Installation Cost\\\",\\\"77\\\":\\\"Fixed at Rs. 30,000.\\\",\\\"78\\\":\\\"Total Cost\\\",\\\"79\\\":\\\"The sum of panel cost, inverter cost, and installation cost (e.g., \\\\\\\"Rs. 97,500\\\\\\\").\\\",\\\"80\\\":\\\"Example:\\\",\\\"81\\\":\\\"For a budget of Rs. 200,000 and default Small (150W) panel price of Rs. 7,500:\\\",\\\"82\\\":\\\"Quantity: 8 panels\\\",\\\"83\\\":\\\"Panel Cost: Rs. 60,000\\\",\\\"84\\\":\\\"Power Generated: 1,200 W - 360 W (30%) = 840 W\\\",\\\"85\\\":\\\"Inverter Size: 3kW\\\",\\\"86\\\":\\\"Inverter Cost: Rs. 30,000\\\",\\\"87\\\":\\\"Installation Cost: Rs. 30,000\\\",\\\"88\\\":\\\"Total Cost: Rs. 120,000\\\",\\\"89\\\":\\\"Below the panel table, the\\\",\\\"90\\\":\\\"table shows appliances that can be powered by each panel type\'s net power output.\\\",\\\"91\\\":\\\"The table includes:\\\",\\\"92\\\":\\\"Appliance\\\",\\\"93\\\":\\\"Name of the appliance (e.g., LED Bulb, AC).\\\",\\\"94\\\":\\\"Power (W)\\\",\\\"95\\\":\\\"Power consumption of the appliance (e.g., 10W for LED Bulb, 1,500W for AC).\\\",\\\"96\\\":\\\"Quantity (150W Panels)\\\",\\\"97\\\":\\\"Number of appliances supported by Small panels.\\\",\\\"98\\\":\\\"Quantity (350W Panels)\\\",\\\"99\\\":\\\"Number of appliances supported by Medium panels.\\\",\\\"100\\\":\\\"Quantity (550W Panels)\\\",\\\"101\\\":\\\"Number of appliances supported by Large panels.\\\",\\\"102\\\":\\\"The tool prioritizes high-power appliances (e.g., AC, Water Pump) when sufficient power is available, then allocates remaining power to smaller appliances (e.g., LED Bulb, Fan).\\\",\\\"103\\\":\\\"Each appliance has a maximum quantity limit (e.g., 1 for AC, 10 for LED Bulbs) to ensure practical recommendations.\\\",\\\"104\\\":\\\"For 840W (Small panels):\\\",\\\"105\\\":\\\"AC (1,500W): 0 (insufficient power)\\\",\\\"106\\\":\\\"Electric Kettle (1,200W): 0 (insufficient power)\\\",\\\"107\\\":\\\"LED Bulb (10W): 10 (max allowed)\\\",\\\"108\\\":\\\"Ceiling Fan (75W): 3 (max allowed)\\\",\\\"109\\\":\\\"Remaining appliances: Quantities based on available power and max limits.\\\",\\\"110\\\":\\\"After calculating results, click the\\\",\\\"111\\\":\\\"Generate PDF\\\",\\\"112\\\":\\\"button (labeled with a download icon or text).\\\",\\\"113\\\":\\\"The tool will create a PDF report titled Solar_System_Calculation_YYYY-MM-DD.pdf (e.g., Solar_System_Calculation_2025-7-16.pdf).\\\",\\\"114\\\":\\\"The PDF includes:\\\",\\\"115\\\":\\\"Title: \\\\\\\"Solar System Calculation Report\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"116\\\":\\\"Budget: Your entered budget (e.g., \\\\\\\"Budget: Rs. 200,000\\\\\\\")\\\",\\\"117\\\":\\\"Date: The current date (e.g., \\\\\\\"Generated on: 7\\\\\\/16\\\\\\/2025\\\\\\\")\\\",\\\"118\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Options Table: Same columns as the on-screen panel table.\\\",\\\"119\\\":\\\"Recommended Appliances Table: Same columns as the on-screen appliance table.\\\",\\\"120\\\":\\\"Note: Information about daytime operation, no battery, and 30% power loss.\\\",\\\"121\\\":\\\"The PDF will automatically download to your device\\\\u2019s default download location.\\\",\\\"122\\\":\\\"Ensure the jsPDF library is loaded (internet connection required). If the PDF fails to generate, check your internet connection or browser console for errors.\\\",\\\"123\\\":\\\"To clear all inputs and results, click the\\\",\\\"124\\\":\\\"button (labeled with a refresh icon or text).\\\",\\\"125\\\":\\\"This will:\\\",\\\"126\\\":\\\"Clear the budget input field.\\\",\\\"127\\\":\\\"Reset panel prices to defaults (Rs. 7,500, Rs. 16,000, Rs. 22,000).\\\",\\\"128\\\":\\\"Clear all calculated values in the panel table (e.g., Quantity: 0, Total Cost: 0).\\\",\\\"129\\\":\\\"Clear the appliance table.\\\",\\\"130\\\":\\\"Hide the results section.\\\",\\\"131\\\":\\\"You can start a new calculation by entering a new budget and clicking \\\\\\\"Calculate\\\\\\\".\\\",\\\"132\\\":\\\"Power Loss:\\\",\\\"133\\\":\\\"The tool assumes a 30% power loss due to inefficiencies (e.g., heat, wiring). The displayed power is the net usable power.\\\",\\\"134\\\":\\\"Inverter Sizing:\\\",\\\"135\\\":\\\"The inverter size is calculated as 1.25x the net power to handle peak loads, rounded up to the nearest available inverter (3kW, 5kW, or 10kW).\\\",\\\"136\\\":\\\"No Battery:\\\",\\\"137\\\":\\\"The system is designed for daytime use, so no battery costs are included.\\\",\\\"138\\\":\\\"Currency:\\\",\\\"139\\\":\\\"All costs are in Pakistani Rupees (PKR).\\\",\\\"140\\\":\\\"Minimum Budget:\\\",\\\"141\\\":\\\"The Rs. 150,000 minimum ensures at least one panel and inverter can be purchased with installation costs.\\\",\\\"142\\\":\\\"Appliance Prioritization:\\\",\\\"143\\\":\\\"High-power appliances (e.g., AC, Water Pump) are prioritized when sufficient power is available to ensure practical system design.\\\",\\\"144\\\":\\\"Results\\\",\\\"145\\\":\\\"Solar Panel Options\\\",\\\"146\\\":\\\"Small (150 W)\\\",\\\"147\\\":\\\"Medium (350 W)\\\",\\\"148\\\":\\\"Large (550W)\\\",\\\"149\\\":\\\"Panels\\\",\\\"150\\\":\\\"LED Bulb\\\",\\\"151\\\":\\\"Tube Light\\\",\\\"152\\\":\\\"Ceiling Fan\\\",\\\"153\\\":\\\"Laptop\\\",\\\"154\\\":\\\"Refrigerator\\\",\\\"155\\\":\\\"TV\\\",\\\"156\\\":\\\"Washing Machine\\\",\\\"157\\\":\\\"Water Pump\\\",\\\"158\\\":\\\"Microwave\\\",\\\"159\\\":\\\"Iron\\\",\\\"160\\\":\\\"Electric Kettle\\\",\\\"161\\\":\\\"AC\\\",\\\"162\\\":\\\"Note: Costs include solar panels, inverter, and installation for daytime operation. No battery included. Power generated accounts for 30% losses. Appliances prioritized to include high-power devices like AC when sufficient power is available.\\\",\\\"h-0\\\":\\\"Calcify\\\",\\\"h-1\\\":\\\"Hub\\\",\\\"h-2\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"h-3\\\":\\\"Tools\\\",\\\"h-4\\\":\\\"Estimators\\\",\\\"h-5\\\":\\\"Usage Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-6\\\":\\\"Budget Base Solar\\\",\\\"h-7\\\":\\\"Construction Cost\\\",\\\"h-8\\\":\\\"Formatters & Convertors\\\",\\\"h-9\\\":\\\"Text Formatter\\\",\\\"h-10\\\":\\\"Text Encrypt\\\\\\/Decrypt\\\",\\\"h-11\\\":\\\"Image Converter\\\",\\\"h-12\\\":\\\"Pdf To word\\\",\\\"h-13\\\":\\\"Others\\\",\\\"h-14\\\":\\\"Age Calculator\\\",\\\"h-15\\\":\\\"Tax Calculator\\\",\\\"h-16\\\":\\\"Minify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-17\\\":\\\"Unminify Js\\\\\\/Css\\\",\\\"h-18\\\":\\\"Compare Data\\\",\\\"h-19\\\":\\\"About Us\\\",\\\"h-20\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"f-0\\\":\\\"Your Daily Utility Hub\\\",\\\"f-1\\\":\\\"Pages\\\",\\\"f-2\\\":\\\"Newsletter\\\",\\\"f-3\\\":\\\"Subscribe to get updates on new tools and features.\\\",\\\"f-4\\\":\\\"Your email\\\",\\\"f-5\\\":\\\"Subscribe\\\",\\\"f-6\\\":\\\"\\\\u00a9 2025 Calcify Hub. All rights reserved.\\\",\\\"f-7\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"f-8\\\":\\\"Terms & Conditions\\\"}\"', '2025-07-21 06:21:03', '2025-08-01 01:05:36'),
